'''Lucario''' (Japanese: '''ルカリオ''' ''Lucario'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

