==Trivia==
The illustration rare card features {{p|Lucario}}, {{p|Hitmonchan}}, {{p|Hitmontop}}, {{p|Medicham}} and {{p|Mienshao}}.

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Lucario|71}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion, as was its '''Submarine Blow''' attack. 
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

